  "title": "Hide Stories (NOT mark them as read)",
  "summary": "Hello @samuelclay Hello guys I have an idea, hope you appreciate and can help. In some feeds I see a lot of stories I am not intrerested in. It is OK I see them but I dont want to read them and I want them to disappear from my feed/List. AND at the same time I dont want to mark them as read. Just the stories I really read, should be marked so und go to “Read Stories”. Is it possible to bring an “Hide” button? Or is there a similar function I didnt see? Thanks",
